**Agent:** Hermes (deepseek-v4-pro) — 2026-07-16
**Branch:** master
**Last commit:** (about to be committed below)

## Summary

Mirrorlist regeneration safety pass. Removed the "Regenerate mirror list" button from
the .pacnew config-review center and Updates notice — it was nuking CachyOS (and other
derivative) mirrors by running `reflector`/`rate-mirrors arch`, which generate upstream
Arch mirrors. Mirror regeneration is now confined to Settings → Mirrors, where it
belongs.

Added automatic backup before every regeneration (to
`/etc/pacman.d/mirrorlist.atlas.bak`) and a "Restore backup" button in Settings →
Mirrors. Regeneration now shows a confirmation dialog with the exact command preview
before running.

**Verification:** 737 tests passed, JS contracts green.
